    "hero": "/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/crimp-contact-pins-machining.jpg",
    "heroDescription": "CNCPioneer is a precision crimp contact pins manufacturer delivering high-reliability electrical contact components with tolerances as tight as ±0.003mm — 78+ Swiss CNC lathes, 66+ MAZAK mill-turn centers, gold, silver, tin, and palladium plating, aerospace FAIR and automotive PPAP documentation.",
    "overview": [
      "Crimp contact pins are precision-machined electrical contact components that terminate wire conductors through mechanical crimping — compressing the crimp barrel around the stripped wire conductor to create a gas-tight, low-resistance electrical connection without soldering.",
      "A crimp contact pin consists of three precision zones: the contact pin zone (male pin establishing the electrical contact interface), the transition zone (governing retention in the connector insert), and the crimp barrel zone (accepting the stripped wire and deforming plastically during crimping)."
    ],
